        "description": "Returns Tidewell Mobile&#39;s reference definitions of the bill-comparison categories (plan, roaming, premium_content, voice_sms, taxes_fees, other) and columns (previous_amount, latest_amount, delta, previous_total, latest_total). Takes no parameters, is read-only and contains no customer data. Call it at most once, only if a category in your input is unclear.",
